  CHANGES TO THE ORIGINAL FILE
  SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2025-2026 Stefano Chizzolini and contributors
  SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
  TEMPLATE-VERSION: 1.0 (2026-11-22)
  Changes:
  - sorting: entries within each change type are sorted by scope, followed by unscoped entries
    sorted by message, case-insensitively.
    NOTE: scoped and unscoped entries are handled separately because Jinja's `sort` cannot compare
    None with a string.
  - grouping by scope: each scope is rendered once as a top-level bullet ("- **scope**:"), with its
    messages as plain bullets indented one level deeper. Scopes that differ only in case (for
    example, "api" and "API") are grouped together, under the spelling that appears first. Unscoped
    entries are rendered as plain top-level bullets after the scoped groups.
  - deduplication: entries with an identical scope + message are shown only once per change type
    within a release. The scope part of the comparison is case-insensitive, to match the grouping;
    the message part is exact. The same message under different scopes (for example,
    "api: clean up code" and "ui: clean up code") is preserved. An unscoped message is deduplicated
    only against other unscoped entries, not against scoped ones.
  - multi-line messages: messages spanning several lines (typically BREAKING CHANGE bodies) are
    flattened by the `flatten` macro: line breaks are removed and the lines are joined with a single
    space, except that each bulleted line ("- " or "* ") is kept on its own line, indented one level
    deeper than the entry's own bullet so that it renders as a sub-item. Blank lines are dropped,
    and a non-bulleted line following a bullet is treated as the continuation of that bullet.
#}

{% macro flatten(message, pad) -%}
{%- set m = namespace(text="") -%}
{%- for line in (message | replace("\r", "")).split("\n") -%}
{%- set l = line | trim -%}
{%- if not l -%}
{%- elif m.text and (l.startswith("- ") or l.startswith("* ")) -%}
{%- set m.text = m.text ~ "\n" ~ pad ~ l -%}
{%- elif m.text -%}
{%- set m.text = m.text ~ " " ~ l -%}
{%- else -%}
{%- set m.text = l -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{{ m.text }}
{%- endmacro %}
{% for entry in tree %}

## {{ entry.version }}{% if entry.date %} ({{ entry.date }}){% endif %}

{% for change_key, changes in entry.changes.items() %}

{% if change_key %}
### {{ change_key }}
{% endif %}

{% set scoped = changes | selectattr("scope") | sort(attribute="scope,message", case_sensitive=false) %}
{% set unscoped = changes | rejectattr("scope") | sort(attribute="message", case_sensitive=false) %}
{% set ns = namespace(scope="", seen=[]) %}
{% for change in scoped %}
{% set id = (change.scope | lower) ~ "|" ~ change.message %}
{% if id not in ns.seen %}
{% set _ = ns.seen.append(id) %}
{% if (change.scope | lower) != ns.scope %}
{% set ns.scope = change.scope | lower %}
- **{{ change.scope }}**:
{% endif %}
  - {{ flatten(change.message, "    ") }}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% for change in unscoped %}
{% if change.message and change.message not in ns.seen %}
{% set _ = ns.seen.append(change.message) %}
- {{ flatten(change.message, "  ") }}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% endfor %}
{% endfor %}
